# Backend Documentation – Hospitality ERP Suite

The Hospitality ERP Suite is an integrated system designed for hotels and restaurants to
streamline operations. It includes modules for reservations, inventory management, staff
coordination, and billing. The backend is developed using FastAPI with PostgreSQL as the
database, providing scalability, security, and flexibility.

## Features Implemented
✅ User Registration & Login
✅ Password Hashing (Bcrypt)
✅ JWT Token Authentication
✅ Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
✅ PostgreSQL database integration

-Rooms: Add rooms, list rooms, update room status

-Bookings: Create bookings, check-in, check-out

-Housekeeping: Assign housekeeping tasks

-Authentication Ready: Manager/Staff role-based endpoints

#Backend (Tech Stack):
-FastAPI
-PostgreSQL
-SQLAlchemy
–Pydantic
–Passlib (Bcrypt)
–Python-Jose
–Uvicorn
-CORS Middleware

